    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d222">

                <pb facs="0416" n="320" xml:id="pg320"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. White to Mr. Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-02-05"><hi rendition="#italic">February 5,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Hamburg consul reports examination commenced and all fresh fruit admitted, except
                    81 cases where claim is made scale insect was found. No trouble about dried
                    fruit.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">White.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
